# vew_component_version (Resource)

Creates and updates a component version, then waits for VEW validation.
Releasing a validated version is a separate `vew_component_version_release`
action. Terraform delete retires the version. The full `definition_json` is
stored in Terraform state, so secure state and plan files accordingly.

